OL,3,GNEWSAOmagh inquiry told gardai warned
OL,4,ARUC of car bomb crossing border
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Omagh Bombing Inquiry has heard
OL,7,Fthat the gardai (Irish police) warned
OL,8,Fthe RUC that a car bomb was to cross
OL,9,Fthe border the day before the atrocity.
OL,11,FAs the hearing resumed in Belfast on
OL,12,FMonday, lead counsel for the inquiry
OL,13,FPaul Greaney KC outlined the evidence
OL,14,Fto be heard over the week as he
OL,15,Fsummarised the evidence to come from
OL,16,Fformer chief superintendent Norman
OL,17,FBaxter.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
