OL,3,GNEWSAOmagh inquiry told gardai warned
OL,4,ARUC of car bomb crossing border
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt heard that in response to the
OL,7,Fwarning, the RUC carried out a
OL,8,F"proactive police operation" in Newry,
OL,9,Fwhich they believed might be the route
OL,10,Fto a target.
OL,12,FThe Omagh bomb crossed over from the
OL,13,FRepublic into Northern Ireland at
OL,14,FAughnacloy in County Tyrone.
